  "details": "I could not join any instances of Room of the Rain at all. Cleared my cache, restarted VRChat. Same problem! Had another friend (thanks, Dyslex1k) reproduce the issue with exact results. Another user on Live could join just fine.\n\nFor context, a little sooner before I tried joining that world, I had pink error shaders on another world where users on Live could see just fine. I have the suspicion that the error with Room of the Rain may also have to do with shaders, but I can send my player logs if necessary. Should be easy to re-pro.\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_fae3fa95-bc18-46f0-af57-f0c97c0ca90a",
